## cmd.exe information gathering
MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.003 (Command and Scripting Interpreter: Windows Command Shell)
Tactic: discovery

User enumeration

### Commands (windows/psh)
```powershell
cmd.exe /c "net user" >> C:\Windows\temp\history.log;
cmd.exe /c "whoami /priv" >> C:\Windows\temp\history.log;
cmd.exe /c "netstat -ano" >> C:\Windows\temp\history.log;
```

